Agree & enter:
This function can only be activated in a drive cycle in P, with all occupants' seat belts fastened; seat belts must stay fastened throughout. Unfastening any seat belt during a stop exits Drift mode automatically;
Battery must be above 20%SOC to activate; it exits automatically when SOC drops below 20%;
All vehicle systems must be working normally to activate; it exits automatically if a fault occurs;
Requirements:
1. Use this function only on race tracks or professional venues that meet national safety standards. Never use it on public roads or in places that do not meet safety standards.
2. For safety, use the original drift kit accessories when using Drift mode.
3. Drift mode requires professional driving skills; the driver must have at least x years of driving experience.
When Drift mode is active:
1. Power mode is set to Sport;
2. E-pedal and Autohold are off by default.
3. ESC is turned off.
4. Energy regeneration is set to low.
